    <name>Trans Northern Trail March 2026</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Contains public sector information licensed under the Open Government Licence v3.0<br><br>N Yorks PRoW: https://www.northyorks.gov.uk/roads-parking-and-travel/public-rights-way/definitive-map-public-rights-way<br><br>E Yorks PRoW: https://www.eastriding.gov.uk/leisure/countryside-and-walks/public-rights-of-way/definitive-map/<br><br>The master GPX designed and monitored by Phil Winrow must always be downloaded from the excellent FB group here: https://www.facebook.com/groups/2811764032373817/files/files<br><br>GPX line on/off<br>Pins on/off<br>Trails on/off<br>Council boundaries on/off<br>Water crossings noted on trails layer.]]></description>
